{
  "category": "Desert Croc Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "They live in groups of a few individuals. Protective membranes shield their eyes from sandstorms.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "The special membrane covering its eyes can sense the heat of objects, so it can see its surroundings even in darkness.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "Protected by thin membranes, their eyes can see even in the dead of night. They live in groups of a few individuals.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Protected by thin membranes, their eyes can see even in the dead of night. They live in groups of a few individuals.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "They live in groups of a few individuals. Protective membranes shield their eyes from sandstorms.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "The special membrane covering its eyes can sense the heat of objects, so it can see its surroundings even in darkness.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "They live in groups of a few individuals. Protective membranes shield their eyes from sandstorms.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "The special membrane covering its eyes can sense the heat of objects, so it can see its surroundings even in darkness.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "They move in groups of a few individuals. A female is often the leader of the group, and the males will gather food.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks to the special membrane covering its eyes, it can see its surroundings clearly, even in the middle of the night.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Krokorok really hates it when its body gets cold. On nights when the temperature drops, it digs deep into the desert sands.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It buries some of its prey in the sand to use as emergency meals when its hunts are unsuccessful.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Krokorok has specialized eyes that enable it to see in the dark. This ability lets Krokorok hunt in the dead of night without getting lost.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although this Pokémon has specialized eyes that allow it to see in the dark, Krokorok won’t move much at night—the desert gets cold after sunset.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
